# Panacea Design System (mandatory)

Do **not** invent one-off colors, fonts, or form/table/button styles. Reuse tokens in `src/app/globals.css` and shared classes below.

Source of truth: `docs/DESIGN_SYSTEM.md`

## Typography

- UI font: **Poppins** (`--font-body` / `--font-display` / `--font-mono`)
- Display headings: **Bodoni Moda** for sidebar subsections (`.shell-subnavEditorial`). **Source Sans 3** for Center Management list page titles (`.cmph-title` / `CenterManagementPageHeader`). Parent nav labels stay Poppins.
- Never use Georgia, Inter, Arial, system stacks, cursive, or other one-off fonts

## Shell

- Sidebar + top navbar backgrounds: **pure white** `#FFFFFF`
- Do not restyle shell layout/structure unless asked

## Core tokens (use these)

| Token | Value | Use |
|-------|-------|-----|
| `--color-accent` | `#5D5FEF` | Primary buttons, table headers, focus |
| `--color-accent-hover` | `#4B51E0` | Primary hover |
| `--color-accent-soft` | `#E8F2FF` | Form section / soft surfaces |
| `--color-input-bg` | `#F8FAFC` | Inputs, selects, textareas |
| `--border` | `#E8EDF5` | Borders |
| `--modal-header-bg` | `#DEECFF` | Modal/drawer header band only |
| `--form-section-bg` | `#DEECFF` | Optional nested sections — not used as popup form frame |
| `--color-close` | `#E53935` | Popup Close action |

## Required shared classes

- **Buttons:** `ui-btn` + `ui-btn-primary` | `ui-btn-outline` | `ui-btn-secondary` | `ui-btn-danger`
- **Inputs / dropdowns:** `ui-input` / `ui-select` / `ui-textarea` + `ui-label` + `ui-field`
- **Tables:** `ui-table` (thead = accent bg + white text)
- **Popups:** `Modal` / `Drawer` **only** — never hand-roll backdrop/header/footer
- **Popup fields:** prefer `ui-grid-2` two-column layout; footer = outline Cancel + primary Save
- **Page forms:** `mod-form-card`

## Popup contract (all Add / Edit views)

```tsx
// ❌ BAD — custom modal markup
<div className="fixed inset-0...">...</div>

// ✅ GOOD — shared Modal (Room Information pattern)
<Modal
  open={open}
  title="Room Information"
  onClose={onClose}
  footer={
    <>
      <button type="button" className="ui-btn ui-btn-outline" onClick={onClose}>Cancel</button>
      <button type="button" className="ui-btn ui-btn-primary" onClick={onSave}>Save</button>
    </>
  }
>
  <div className="ui-grid-2">...</div>
</Modal>
```

## Rules

```tsx
// ❌ BAD — custom colors / native controls without system classes
<button style={{ background: '#6366F1' }}>Save</button>
<input className="border rounded p-2" />

// ✅ GOOD
<button className="ui-btn ui-btn-primary">Save</button>
<div className="ui-field">
  <label className="ui-label">Name</label>
  <input className="ui-input" />
</div>
<table className="ui-table">...</table>
```

When adding UI: extend tokens/classes in `globals.css` / `module.css` if needed — do not bypass the system.
